OL,3,ARiver water smashed into tunnel and
OL,4,Achased me for 20 minutes, Nepal worker
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FNepalese hydropower workers have told
OL,8,Fthe BBC about the catastrophic moment
OL,9,Fwater from the Trishuli River crashed
OL,10,Finto their tunnel as the region was
OL,11,Finundated by deadly flash floods last
OL,12,Fweek.
OL,14,FIt started with a sudden, strong gust
OL,15,Fof air, says Pemba Dundu Tamang, whose
OL,16,Fteam of about 30 was constructing the
OL,17,Ftunnel's concrete lining.
OL,19,FThe blast of wind sent plywood flying
OL,20,Fthrough the air and dislodged heavy
OL,21,Fmachinery. Just outside, houses had
OL,22,Falready been swept away.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
